{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25257","headline":"南溪诗 · 李渤","name":"南溪诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄岩丽南溪，新泉发幽色。\n岩泉孕灵秀，云烟纷崖壁。\n斜峰信天插，奇洞固神辟。\n窈窕去未穷，环回势难极。\n玉池似无水，玄井昏不测。\n仙户掩复开，乳膏凝更滴。\n丹砂有遗址，石径无留迹。\n南眺苍梧云，北望洞庭客。\n萧条风烟外，爽朗形神寂。\n若值浮丘翁，从此谢尘役。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李渤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}